# .pypi.env — private package registry credentials for `task publish`.
#
# Deliberately a SEPARATE file from .env: .env is deployed to every running
# instance (production boards included, see production/README.md) and holds
# app secrets (CAMERA_PASSWORD, GUI_PASSWORD, ...). .pypi.env is only ever
# read on a maintainer's machine at publish time — never copied to a board.
#
# Copy this file to `.pypi.env` and fill in your values. `.pypi.env` is
# git-ignored; only this example is committed.
#
# Any PyPI-compatible "simple" index works — a Gitea package registry
# (https://<host>/api/packages/<owner>/pypi), a GitLab package registry
# (https://<host>/api/v4/projects/<id>/packages/pypi), devpi, Nexus, etc.
PYPI_INDEX_URL=
PYPI_USERNAME=
PYPI_PASSWORD=
